title: MiniBossDialogue
---
Emilia: Jubilee…
Jubilee: Emilia! It’s about time you showed up... I’ve been so lost without you… You have to be more careful, y’know! There’s thousands of widows on the ceiling waiting to drop on to their next prey! Fortunately, I was there to save you before it could turn you into one of those drooling bastards! You just stick a knife underneath the nerve attached to the neck… and POP! You’re no longer Widow food!
<i>Emilia is too shocked to move.</i>
Jubilee: If you didn’t stomp off and have your tantrum when you did, all of our research would have been lost in the cave-in. We discovered an ecosystem in that cave full of organisms disconnected from the rest of the world for 5 million years! In the grand scheme of things, is the entire team really necessary? I mean, don’t get me wrong… being trapped under rubble and breathing in toxic gases with no hope of survival was definitely a drag. But, I guess you were right! We shouldn’t have been messing with the ecosystem down there…
Jubilee: Nature punished us for it. Bahaha!
Emilia: Enough!
Jubilee: !
Emilia: How dare you use her face to talk…
Emilia: Widow…
Jubilee: ...
Jubilee: Well…
Jubilee: It was worth a shot! I thought maybe you’d take the bait if I showed you a bit of kindness. But I dunno… you treated her pretty badly even in her own memories…
Jubilee: Might’ve been too unrealistic for you. <i>Hehehe…</i>
Emilia: When…?
Jubilee: Hmm?
Emilia: A brood of Widows take the form of whatever their mother eats, right? When did you kill her?
Jubilee: Now, now, does it really matter at this point? What I said before was true, you know! She really did spend the last moments of her life utterly hopeless.
Emilia: ...
Jubilee: You, human, seem to be very knowledgeable about us Widows. And yet... You walked straight into our domain. If you wanted to see your Jubilee so badly...
Jubilee: I’LL HELP YOU MYSELF!
<<BeginBattle FightJubilee>>
===
